//= Collection of Prontera-based quests.
//= * Culvert Access
//= * Ph.D Hat Quest
//= * Geoborg Family Curse
//===== Comments: ============================================
//= Culvert Access:
//= - [Official Conversion]
//= - Variable in use: MISC_QUEST (bit 8)
//= Ph.D Hat Quest:
//= - [Official Conversion]
//= - n/a
//= Geoborg Family Curse:
//= - [Official Conversion]
//= - Variable in use: prt_curse (max 61)
